 ## Background
-Mixer-NeRF was proposed to address the issue that simple multi-layer perceptron (MLP) models in NeRF often result in blurry details due to a lack of necessary local information capture during the sampling process [S1]. The method introduces joint learning based on hybrid spatial feature information to enhance detail reconstruction [S1].
+Mixer-NeRF was proposed to address the limitations of simple Multi-Layer Perceptron (MLP) models in NeRF, which often result in blurry details due to a lack of necessary local information capture during the sampling process [S1]. The method introduces hybrid spatial feature information learning to enhance detail reconstruction [S1].
 
